[{:adr/consequences "{:positive [\"読書 UX が manga.gftd.ai 同等 (一覧 → reader、RTL 見開き/単頁/縦読)\" \"viewer ロジックが pure cljc として単体テスト・再利用可能\" \"mangaka-reader Worker SSR 置換の受け皿\"], :negative [\"viewer 実装は当面 2 本 (Worker は手書きのまま)\" \"works-list 供給は consumer 責務 (ライブラリは持たない)\"]}", :adr/authoritative_for ["manga viewer の UI/ロジック正本は kotoba-lang/manga-viewer (public,\n    pure cljc, zero runtime deps): model (正規化 work + from-gh-manga-tx /\n    from-mangaka-data adapter) / pagination (RTL 見開き units,\n    supported-modes) / style (css 文字列) / render (works-grid + reader\n    pure hiccup)。状態と event handler は consumer 注入" "aozora.app は consumer: /manga = work-actor registry の works-grid\n    index、/manga/ghosthacker = manga-viewer reader (単頁+縦読 —\n    パネル画像作品のため見開き非対応)。ghosthacker 以外の 3 作品の reader は\n    manga.gftd.ai へリンク (blob key が D1 にしか無く公開 API 不在のため)" "RTL 見開き規約: cover 単独 → 以降 2 頁組、unit 内は大きい頁番号が左\n    (manga.gftd.ai reader と同一。pagination/units + render の逆順描画)" "mangaka-reader Worker の manga-viewer SSR 置換・全画面/バー自動隠しは\n    follow-up (v1 意図的非対象)"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "kotoba-lang-manga-viewer", :adr/related ["90-docs/adr/2607070400-app-aozora-manga-work-actor-profiles.md" "90-docs/adr/2607021700-manga-as-social-post-embed-external.md" "orgs/kotoba-lang/liquid-glass-ui (pure-hiccup view 層の前例)"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607070500-kotoba-lang-manga-viewer-aozora-integration", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-07", :adr/decision "{:chosen [\"kotoba-lang/manga-viewer を新規 public repo として scaffold\\n    (model / pagination / style / render + cognitect test-runner)\" \"aozora SPA classpath に manga-viewer/src を追加し、/manga index 新設 +\\n    /manga/ghosthacker reader 置換 (共有ボタン・byline は維持)\" \"viewer CSS はページ root への inline style で自己完結\"], :rejected [{:option \"app-aozora 内に viewer を直接実装\", :why \"viewer ロジックの 2 実装分裂が固定化し、mangaka-reader 側の\\n          将来の SSR 置換の受け皿が無くなる\"} {:option \"manga.gftd.ai Worker を今すぐ manga-viewer SSR に置換\", 